        "node_id": "n_2_6f359e",
        "thought_text": "For each word in the dictionary, temporarily remove it and check if the shortest path between the start and end words increases. If it does, consider adding this word back and calculate the new path length. Track the word that minimizes the path length, ensuring alphabetical order if ties occur.",
