        "node_id": "n_5_90376e",
        "thought_text": "The BFS implementation might not correctly handle cases where the shortest path is not found. Ensure that the BFS function returns -1 when no path is found, and update the logic in `find_best_word_to_add` to handle this case properly. Additionally, verify that the BFS correctly handles the addition of the new word to the dictionary.",
