        "node_id": "n_6_1ce7ea",
        "thought_text": "Consider optimizing the BFS function by using a priority queue instead of a regular queue to always expand the shortest path first. This might help in quickly identifying the shortest path and reduce the overall execution time. Also, ensure that the BFS function is correctly handling the case where the start and end words are the same.",
