        "node_id": "n_10_1b5fc2",
        "thought_text": "Instead of generating potential new words by changing each letter of each word in the dictionary one at a time, consider generating all possible one-letter transformations of the starting and ending words. Then, check which of these transformations, when added to the dictionary, can create a valid path between the starting and ending words. This approach might help in identifying the optimal word to add more efficiently.",
