        "node_id": "n_11_15a5d8",
        "thought_text": "The current BFS implementation does not account for the possibility of adding a new word to the dictionary. Modify the BFS function to accept an additional parameter representing the new word to be added. Include this word in the dictionary during the BFS search to determine if it helps in reducing the number of steps. This adjustment should help in correctly evaluating the impact of adding each potential new word.",
