        "node_id": "n_12_6a6390",
        "thought_text": "Optimize the search by first checking if the direct transformation from the starting word to the ending word is possible without adding any new words. If not, then explore the potential impact of adding each word in the dictionary one by one, using a priority queue to always expand the most promising paths first based on the number of steps required. This greedy approach might lead to finding the optimal word to add more quickly.",
